exports[`golden SVG > architecture-icons.mmdx × dracula 1`] = `
"<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="44 1.4 1107.2 557.4" width="1107.2" height="557.4" role="img" aria-label="Online shop architecture"><title>Online shop architecture</title><desc>Shoppers reach the web app through the CDN; the API gateway
calls the order, payment and search services, which keep
