"<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="44 1.4 1107.2 557.4" width="1107.2" height="557.4" role="img" aria-label="Online shop architecture"><title>Online shop architecture</title><desc>Shoppers reach the web app through the CDN; the API gateway
calls the order, payment and search services, which keep
their data in a database, a queue and a search index.</desc><defs><marker id="t-mk-open-b7bdc8-11" viewBox="0 0 10 10" refX="9.4" refY="5" markerWidth="11" markerHeight="11" markerUnits="userSpaceOnUse" orient="auto-start-reverse"><path d="M1,1 L9,5 L1,9" fill="none" stroke="#b7bdc8" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></marker><marker id="t-mk-filled-b7bdc8-11" viewBox="0 0 10 10" refX="9.4" refY="5" markerWidth="11" markerHeight="11" markerUnits="userSpaceOnUse" orient="auto-start-reverse"><path d="M0,0.6 L10,5 L0,9.4 L2.6,5 z" fill="#b7bdc8"/></marker></defs><rect class="page" x="44" y="1.4" width="1107.2" height="557.4" fill="#0d1117"/><g class="title" data-part="title"><text text-anchor="middle" dominant-baseline="central" font-family="Roboto, &#39;Segoe UI&#39;, &#39;Helvetica Neue&#39;, Arial, sans-serif" font-size="22" font-weight="600" fill="#f0f6fc"><tspan x="597.6" y="31.7">Online shop architecture</tspan></text></g><g class="el group" data-kind="group" data-id="clients"><rect x="60" y="139.4" width="276.1" height="143.4" rx="12" fill="#151b23" stroke="#3d444d" stroke-width="1.2"/><text text-anchor="middle" dominant-baseline="central" font-family="Roboto, &#39;Segoe UI&#39;, &#39;Helvetica Neue&#39;, Arial, sans-serif" font-size="14" font-weight="600" fill="#f0f6fc"><tspan x="165.8" y="156.4" text-anchor="start"><tspan x="183.7">Clients</tspan></tspan></text><image href="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns%3D%22http%3A%2F%2Fwww.w3.org%2F2000%2Fsvg%22%20viewBox%3D%220%200%2024%2024%22%20width%3D%2214%22%20height%3D%2214%22%3E%3Cpath%20fill%3D%22none%22%20stroke%3D%22%23f0f6fc%22%20stroke-linecap%3D%22round%22%20stroke-linejoin%3D%22round%22%20stroke-width%3D%222%22%20d%3D%22M5%207a4%204%200%201%200%208%200a4%204%200%201%200-8%200M3%2021v-2a4%204%200%200%201%204-4h4a4%204%200%200%201%204%204v2m1-17.87a4%204%200%200%201%200%207.75M21%2021v-2a4%204%200%200%200-3-3.85%22%2F%3E%3C%2Fsvg%3E" x="165.8" y="149.4" width="14" height="14"